Modifications in this distribution:
- Removed bundled custom source scripts and fixed source catalog addresses.
- Empty custom source list and disabled multi-source switching on fresh installs.
- Ordered failover uses only user-imported sources.
- Subscription addresses persist only after user input. Exhausted automatic failover
  checks the saved subscription once per song with a 60-second cooldown, and retries
  one extra round only when catalog or script contents change. Manual updates remain available.
- Updated branding, documentation and distribution checks.
